# Ignore build outputs and cache directories everywhere in the project
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/.output/
**/.tanstack/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.cache/

# Ignore uploads directory where users upload test files
**/uploads/

# Ignore lock files anywhere in the workspace (commented out for production tracking)
# **/Cargo.lock
# **/bun.lock
# **/package-lock.json
# **/yarn.lock
# **/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Ignore environment configurations and credentials
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# Ignore IDE settings
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Local Qwen Code tooling state
.qwen/

